uo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1405697-are-the-chronicles-of-darkness-going-to-stop-being-made?p=1405700#post1405700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What makes you think that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hi! so,some people have expressed worries that there isn't many new cofd products being brought on in a while,the last one was Deviant some 8 months ago.it got me worried too,kinda anxious","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T18:07:01-07:00","id":1405712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1405697-are-the-chronicles-of-darkness-going-to-stop-being-made?p=1405700#post1405700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What makes you think that.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/3132-you-know-what-i-hate-mk-i?p=1405627#post1405627\">I think he's referring to this</a> (in addition to OPP's GenCon Online panel coming and going and no definitive CofD announcements being made).<br /> <br /> My take being: hasn't OPP already been on the record saying that they're easing up on brand new CofD announcements because now they're trying to focus on getting the remaining 2e KS products out first?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T18:42:46-07:00","id":1405720,"title":"","content":"found the link. so they want to get what's already in the pipeline done before jumping to the new stuff? that makes sense,I was just scared to not seee any new cofd stuff in the MMN in a long time But if they are waiting for new stuff to get done then i know it wil be fun to what comes next<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 07-31-2020, 09:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T20:20:16-07:00","id":1405729,"title":"","content":"I think there's also been a bit of a change as a lot of the people that were working on CofD at the release of GMC that aren't working on the line for a wide number of reasons.<br /> <br /> It feels like previously, the games were strongly driven by a lead developer's strong vision for a core and a bunch of supplements. It seems like the CofD has more of a single team on a lot of books. On one hand, this probably leads to stronger consistency overall. And it might be because of Dark Eras and Contagion Chronicles being a big part of things right now. On the other it also seems like supplements are more sparse as most of the CofD writers are shifting between game-lines rather than a few people working on each and floaters to help do the full texts.<br /> <br /> Though this is a completely outsider perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T20:22:33-07:00","id":1405730,"title":"","content":"Makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T21:20:36-07:00","id":1405741,"title":"","content":"As everyone have said, it's simply that they are slowing down. Which I don't see a problem with. Just means when they DO get to making supplements, all gamelines will be ready to get some<br /> <br /> If they ever did fully stop, I promise they would announce something so we would know","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-01T14:41:39-07:00","id":1405834,"title":"","content":"I would be confident that if Onyx Path felt they were going to stop making CofD books, they'd tell us.<br /> <br /> I'm less confident that if Paradox stopped or significantly limited approvals on CofD books that we would hear about it directly; as the 20th lines that don't have a 5th book announced yet besides Ascension (also a good example of what I was saying about the one major developer model of things) or WoD games that haven't even gotten a 20th book at all, haven't been officially announced as done, even if nothing is being made for them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}